"description": "Tompkins Financial Corp. engages in the provision of financial services. It operates through the following segments: Banking and Wealth Management. The Banking segment consists of its banking subsidiaries, including Tompkins Trust Co., The Bank of Castile, Mahopac Bank, and VIST Bank. The Wealth Management segment consists of a comprehensive suite of financial services to customers, including trust and estate services, investment management, and insurance. The company was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Ithaca, NY.",
